# Element (Matrix) — system floor.
#
# Shipped as a floor, not as a recommendation. Matrix's metadata exposure is in
# the federation design and not in this client: every homeserver with a member
# in a room replicates that room's membership, device list and timestamps, and
# keeps them. A sandbox cannot fix a protocol. docs/COMMS.md states this where
# a user will read it before choosing.
NETWORK=allow
FILES=portal
CAMERA=deny
MIC=deny
USB=deny
SENSORS=deny
